ook:Flour|flour]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* ½ cup (120 [[Cookbook:Milliliter|ml]]) [[Cookbook:Milk|milk]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Egg|egg]], [[Cookbook:Beat|beaten]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoon]] [[Cookbook:Vegetable oil|vegetable oil]]\n* 8–10 [[Cookbook:Hot Dog|hot dogs]]\n\n== Equipment ==\n* 8–10 wooden [[Cookbook:Skewer|skewers]]\n\n==Procedure==\n# Preheat [[Cookbook:Deep Fat Frying|deep fat fryer]] to {{#invoke:temperature|f|375}} ({{#invoke:temperature|c|190}}).\n# Combine corn meal, flour, and salt. Add milk, egg, and oil; mix well.\n# Insert a wooden skewer into one end of each hot dog.\n# Coat with flour, then coat with corn meal mixture.\n# [[Cookbook:Fry|Fry]] a few at a time in deep hot oil until golden brown.\n\n== Notes, tips, and variations ==\n* Serve with [[Cookbook:Mustard|mustard]], like at a fair.\n\n[[Category:Inexpensive recipes|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:United States recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using hot dog|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Deep fried recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes_with_metric_units|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cornmeal]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using vegetable oil]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cow milk]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Corn Dogs","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"⅔ cup (160 g) corn meal","sourceText":"⅔ cup (160 g) corn meal","amountText":"⅔ cup (160 g) corn meal","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"⅓ cup (60 g) flour","sourceText":"⅓ cup (60 g) flour","amountText":"⅓ cup (60 g) flour","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 teaspoon salt","sourceText":"1 teaspoon salt","amountText":"1 teaspoon salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"½ cup (120 ml) milk","sourceText":"½ cup (12